# Frontend settings. Nothing is required: in dev, Vite forwards /api to the backend on port 8000.
#
# Only if the backend runs somewhere else:
# VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000/api
#
# API keys (Jev, and later the chat model) go in backend/.env, never here. Every VITE_ variable
# is shipped to the browser. See backend/.env.example and docs/architecture.md ("Run it").
